  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> be a focal chord of the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;such that it subtends an angle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Let the line segment&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> be also a focal chord of the ellipse <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#62;</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi></math>&nbsp;is the eccentricity of the ellipse <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
